# Both training drones share one hull constant. The spawn art and the
# grid_count_grid_data() pre-flight key MUST be the same string: if they drift, the
# guard checks a different hull than the one that exists and its answer is
# meaningless. That is the failure that put INT32_MIN on Science on 2026-08-16.
#
# xim_light_cruiser chosen 2026-08-16 (operator-ratified) over kralien_cruiser.
# Kralien warship hulls are empty placeholders in data/grid_data.json - zero grid
# objects - so the engine has no interior to model subsystem damage against and
# Science is pinned at 100%. xim_light_cruiser carries 75 nodes including 5 weapon
# nodes, and 3 hull points against the Kralien's 2.
#
# Only the hull art changes. Roles stay "kralien, raider, ..." so side relationships,
# the Drone 02 fleet brain, and the stock critical route (which gates on the "raider"
# role, not the hull) all behave exactly as before.
shared drone_hull_art = "xim_light_cruiser"
