# Training telemetry. The stock Science panel does not surface subsystem damage on
# an NPC (cookbook 7.3 - measured, not inferred: system_damage 1.35 against
# system_max_damage 2.0 while the panel displayed 100%). Both keys hold real engine
# values though, so Dillon reports them rather than the crew flying blind.
#
# This REPORTS real telemetry, it does not simulate damage. Nothing here writes a
# damage value or invents a parallel model; it reads what the stock critical already
# wrote and puts it on the Comms channel.
